---
description: >-
  Markdown strings (D710): a set, a union and a text node wholly in
  backticks draw as markdown without their backticks; the plain labels
  beside them keep markdown syntax literal and draw tags and line breaks.
---
venn-beta
  set A["`**bold** set`"]
    text "`*italic* node`"
    text "**literal**"
  set B["Plain <b>tag</b><br>two lines"]
  union A, B["`**both**`"]
